PRINGSEWU REGENCY

LAMPUNG PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF PRINGSEWU REGENCY NUMBER Ot YEAR 2015

CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF PRINGSEWU,

a. that every citizen has human rights that must be guaranteed by the state to obtain a sense of security, be protected and free from all forms of violence.

b. that women and children are vulnerable groups, so they need to receive protection and services from the state that can provide prevention, protection and services to victims of violence;

c. that the regional government together with the community is obliged to organize prevention, protection and recovery efforts for children and women victims of violence for the sake of honor and protection of human dignity;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a, b and c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

